{"id":241563506542765,"type":"album","name":"Nail","artist":"Foetus","year":1985,"weight":12,"info":{"cover":"https://dn711301.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-3c40b481-4332-49d8-bac5-35cc45e0db84/mbid-3c40b481-4332-49d8-bac5-35cc45e0db84-5723438056.jpg","kind":"Album","tracks":10,"country":"GB","scaruffi":9.0,"yt":"XrVwH9lOvek","links":{"spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/album/6kdMZQQOWUejV5GSWhf5S4","youtube":"https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_nyqtDg8ykb2YfB0O8SD7y2o-vCtQwhWtY","rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/scraping-foetus-off-the-wheel/nail"},"desc":"Nail was Thirlwell's fourth album and second under the pseudonym of Scraping Foetus Off The Wheel. The album's content incorporates a variety of musical genres and the lyrics are often esoteric. For example, the tempo and instrumentation in \"Descent Into The Inferno\" is infrequent: the song's first half is sparse and percussive; in the latter stages the song gathers momentum and features synthesisers. \"The Overture From Pigdom Come\", an ironic composition resembling a classical piece of music is juxtaposed with perhaps the most brutal track on the album, \"Private War\", a track that features one minute of various grinding noises. ."},"artist_ref":{"id":23921933746272,"name":"Foetus","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/JG_Thirlwell%2C_Moderna_Museet%2C_Stockholm%2C_Sweden.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":274994627985231,"type":"genre","name":"Industrial","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":604,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":55893123468232,"type":"genre","name":"Experimental Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":373,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"}],"lists":[{"id":52032266791182,"name":"Scaruffi 1980s","src":"musthear","grp":null,"list_year":null,"rank":3,"year":null,"note":null,"total":877,"scaruffi":9.0}],"podcast":[],"book_tracks":[{"id":241563506542765,"artist":"Foetus","artist_id":23921933746272,"title":"Nail","year":1985,"ess":1,